NAME
       less - view text one screen at a time

SYNOPSIS
       less [-N] [FILE]...
       more [FILE]...

DESCRIPTION
       Show FILEs (or standard input) in a full screen pager with scrolling and
       search. The keys are the same as in man(1). When the output is not a
       terminal, the text is copied unchanged.

OPTIONS
       -N
           show line numbers

KEYS
       j/k line, Space/b page, g/G start/end, /TEXT search, n/N next/previous, q quit.

EXAMPLES
       less /root/notes.txt
       ls -l /bin | less

SEE ALSO
       man(1), cat(1), head(1)
